{"title":"Die kleine Hexe","puid":"c-natdeu-3/hb7c2b","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/level-02","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","voice":"m3_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f5_2025"},"trainers":[{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>wooden-door-creak</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/01_Hexe_Haus.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"yellow":"rgba(255,238,88,1)","red":"rgba(244,67,54,1)","brown":"rgba(188,170,164,1)","orange":"rgba(255,167,38,1)"},"atoms":[{"a":"Tief im Wunderwald lebt die  Hexe Runa in einem riesigen Pilz. Zwischen den hohen Zauberblumen fällt das Licht geheimnisvoll auf den Boden. Ihre gelben Blüten leuchten gelb wie die Sonne.","tasks":{"class":"flower","color":"yellow","total":2}},{"a":"Runas Haus erkennt man schon von Weitem. Es hat ein leuchtend rotes Dach mit weißen Punkten und einen hellbraunen Stiel. In der runden, orangen Haustür quietscht leise das Schloss.","tasks":[{"class":"roof","color":"red","total":1},{"class":"house","color":"brown","total":1},{"class":"door","color":"orange","total":1}]}]},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>chimes_magical</voice>","finishButton":true,"textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/01_Hexe_Garten_1.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"green":"rgba(102,187,106,1)","orange":"rgba(251,140,0,1)"},"atoms":{"a":"Hinter dem Haus liegt Runas Zaubergarten. Dort erntet sie viele Zutaten für einen Hexentrank. Ihre Schaufel hat einen orangen Griff und blitzt in der Sonne.<br> Zwischen dem bunten Zaubergemüse zieht Sam, die Schnecke, mit seinem grünen Schneckenhaus eine glitzernde Spur.","tasks":[{"class":"snail","color":"green","total":1},{"class":"shovel","color":"orange","total":1}]}},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/01_Hexe_Garten_2.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"purple":"rgba(171,71,188,1)","blue":"rgba(66,165,245,1)","yellow":"rgba(255,238,88,1)","red":"rgba(239,83,80,1)"},"atoms":{"a":"Plötzlich kriecht Sam direkt auf eine lila Karotte zu. „He, das ist meine!“, lacht Runa und hebt sie schnell hoch. Sie sammelt drei von den lila Karotten, einen blauen Kürbis und vier rote Pilze. Bald wird daraus ein kräftiger Hexentrank.","tasks":[{"class":"carrot","color":"purple","total":3},{"class":"pumpkin","color":"blue","total":1},{"class":"mushroom","color":"red","total":4}]}},{"trainer":"kidColorize","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/01_Hexe-copy.lsg","width":350},"colors":{"orange":"rgba(255,183,77,1)","green":"rgba(102,187,106,1)","purple":"rgba(171,71,188,1)"},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"atoms":{"a":"Die Hexe Runa feiert heute mit allen Freunden aus dem Wunderwald das Fest der geheimen Zauberkünste. Dafür hat sie sich ihr schönstes oranges Oberteil angezogen. Es passt gut zu ihrem lila Rock und dem großen grünen Hexenhut.","tasks":[{"class":"top","color":"orange","total":1},{"class":"skirt","color":"purple","total":1},{"class":"hat","color":"green","total":1}]}},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>bubbles</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/01_Hexe-copy-2.lsg","width":350},"colors":{"blue":"rgba(66,165,245,1)","grey":"rgba(97,97,97,1)"},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"atoms":{"a":"Auch 